    "Use icons instead of text tags where an icon is set (see Damage icons below).": "設定了圖示的地方用圖示代替文字標記（見下方傷害圖示）。",
    "Stay visible": "顯示時間",
    "How long a damage number stays fully visible after it pops up (the game's own: about 0.15 s).": "傷害數字出現後完全可見的時長（遊戲原本約0.15秒）。",
    "Fade out": "淡出時間",
    "How long a damage number takes to fade out.": "傷害數字淡出所需的時長。",
    "HP numbers": "體力數值",
    "Show current / maximum HP as text on the health bars of bosses, adventurers and dark enemies.": "在首領、冒險家和黑暗敵人的體力條上以文字顯示目前/最大體力。",
    "Add your real damage (with your current stats) to the descriptions of skulls, skills, swaps, items, essences and inscriptions.": "在孤骨、技能、輪替、道具、精髓和刻印的說明中加入你的實際傷害（按目前屬性）。",
    "Pickup preview": "拾取預估",
    "Items on the ground, in shops and in the swap menu show their numbers as if you had picked them up (their stats and inscription steps included).": "地上、商店和替換選單中的道具顯示拾取後的數值（包括其屬性和刻印階段）。",
    "Open / close key": "開啟/關閉鍵",
    "The key that opens and closes the combat log.": "開啟和關閉戰鬥紀錄的按鍵。",
    "Dialogue frame": "對話框背景",
    "Use the NPC dialogue box artwork as the window background (off: a plain dark panel).": "用NPC對話框的美術作為視窗背景（關閉：純色暗面板）。",
    "Background": "背景",
    "How solid the dialogue background is (0% invisible, 100% solid).": "對話框背景的不透明度（0%透明，100%不透明）。",
    "Calculations": "計算紀錄",
    "Record how every hit's number came about (stats, items, inscriptions, dark abilities, crits, debuffs); hover a log line to see it.": "記錄每次攻擊數值的來由（屬性、道具、刻印、黑暗能力、暴擊、減益）；將滑鼠停在紀錄行上即可查看。",
    "Save to file": "儲存到文件",
    "Also write every hit (with its calculation) to BepInEx/DamageInsight/CombatLogs, one file per game session (the newest 30 are kept).": "同時把每次攻擊（含計算）寫入 BepInEx/DamageInsight/CombatLogs，每次遊戲一個文件（保留最新30個）。",
    "Show mini log": "顯示迷你紀錄",
    "Show a few log lines above the minimap. Can also be switched in the combat log window.": "在小地圖上方顯示幾行紀錄。也可以在戰鬥紀錄視窗中切換。",
    "Lines": "行數",
    "How many lines the mini log shows.": "迷你紀錄顯示的行數。",
    "Hide after": "隱藏延時",
    "Hide the mini log when no new damage came in for this long.": "在這段時間內沒有新傷害時隱藏迷你紀錄。",
    "Pie chart": "圓餅圖",
    "Show a tiny pie chart at the right of the mini log.": "在迷你紀錄右側顯示一個小圓餅圖。",
    "Gap above map": "與地圖的間距",
    "Distance between the minimap and the mini log (in pixels at 1920x1080).": "小地圖與迷你紀錄之間的距離（以1920x1080下的像素計）。",
    "Show seconds": "顯示秒數",
    "Show the remaining seconds on the item and ability icons at the bottom of the screen (83s, 2m+, 10m).": "在畫面底部的道具和能力圖示上顯示剩餘秒數（83秒、2分+、10分）。",
    "Opacity": "不透明度",
    "How strongly the seconds are drawn.": "秒數顯示的濃淡程度。",
    "Record progress": "記錄進度",
    "Record your progress for the Codex (enemies met and killed, gear found) and capture enemy pictures.": "為圖錄記錄你的進度（遇到和擊殺的敵人、找到的裝備）並拍下敵人的圖像。",
    "The key that opens and closes the Codex book.": "開啟和關閉圖錄的按鍵。",
    "Move hints": "招式提示",
    "Under a boss move in the Codex: when the boss uses it (HP range, distance, cooldown...), read from its AI. Shown once you have beaten the boss.": "在圖錄的首領招式下方顯示首領何時使用（體力區間、距離、冷卻…），從其AI中讀取。擊敗首領後顯示。",
    "Film boss attacks": "錄製首領攻擊",
    "Film each boss attack once (a small picture 10 times a second, effects included) to show it in the Codex.": "每個首領攻擊錄製一次（每秒10張小圖，含特效），在圖錄中展示。",
    "Window position": "視窗位置",
    "Puts the combat log window back to its default place and size (you can drag it and pull its corners; it remembers where you left it).": "把戰鬥紀錄視窗恢復到預設位置和大小（可以拖動視窗、拉動四角調整大小；它會記住你放置的位置）。",
    "All settings": "全部設定",
    "Reset everything": "全部重設",
    "Puts every setting on this page back to its default. Your Codex progress stays as it is.": "把本頁的所有設定恢復為預設值。你的圖錄進度保持不變。",
    "Takes effect in the Codex at once.": "立即在圖錄中生效。",
